<title>GREECE: SARANTOPOULOS ORDERBOOK AT 61.1 BLN DRS.</title>
<headline>SARANTOPOULOS ORDERBOOK AT 61.1 BLN DRS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The uncompleted portion of Greek construction firm Sarantopoulos 's orderbook was boosted to 61.1 billion drachmas following the award of six new projects worth around 13 billion in the past few months, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sarantopoulos was recently awarded an ISO 9002 quality certificate covering the entire spectrum of its operations, it said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
